-- title

al9000.com README

-- notes/

- The site is currently built with the
rust based ``ssg9000`` site builder. 
(Eventually, a custom version will
be rolled into the al9000.com project
itself)

- Starting the server is done with the
``start-dev-server.bash`` script
which fires up ssg9000 for a local build. 

-- /notes


